'''The Ringing Deeps''' is an industrious subterranean [[zone]] in [[Khaz Algar]], inhabited by the [[earthen]] [[Machine Speakers]].

==Getting there==
Players access the Ringing Deeps via the [[Coreway]] of [[Dornogal]] on the surface of the [[Isle of Dorn]] after completing the [[Isle of Dorn storyline]] and starting [[Into the Deeps]].

Players can fly through to [[Hallowfall]] just north of the Coreway at {{co|30|20|Ringing Deeps}} through the [[Hallowfall Gate]], and also to [[Azj-Kahet]] at {{co|40|70|Ringing Deeps}} through the [[Living Grotto]].

